# data/corpus.json and chroma_db/ (the ingested corpus cache and its embedding index) are
# now DVC-tracked (see log.md's DVC entry) — `dvc add` manages precise ignores for the real
# data files in data/.gitignore and chroma_db/.gitignore; only the small .dvc pointer files
# here are meant to be committed to git. Regenerate with `python -m ingestion.ingest_corpus`.

# Local MLflow tracking store (experiment_tracking.py's default) — live, constantly-growing
# local state, not something to version; every eval/report-generation run recreates it.
mlflow.db
